    <briefdescription>
<para>QSGMaterial that fills a band between the low and high values of <computeroutput>(x, low, high)</computeroutput> samples. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The data texture holds three floats per sample. Vertices carry only a sample index and an edge selector, so panning and zooming change uniforms only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
